#
# Provides the PaletteGenerator class with static functions for generating
# harmonious color palettes from a single base color. All algorithms work in
# HSL color space where hue rotation produces natural color harmonies. Supports
# complementary (180 degree), triadic (120 degree), analogous (30 degree),
# split-complementary (150/210 degree), and monochromatic (lightness variation)
# palette types. Each method returns a named ColorPalette containing the
# generated colors.
#
